Rolleiflex DRP- Fomapan 100 - Rodinal 1+25&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2024-01-18 - Joan</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2024/01/19/2024-01-18-joan/</link><pubDate>Fri, 19 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2024/01/19/2024-01-18-joan/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/2024-01-18-Rolleiflex-Foma100-0003.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
