Rolleiflex DRP- Fomapan 100 - Rodinal 1+25&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2024-01-11 - Eli, el retorn</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2024/01/11/2024-01-11-eli-el-retorn/</link><pubDate>Thu, 11 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2024/01/11/2024-01-11-eli-el-retorn/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/KYM3nSUvZmvJTgpK9"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/2024-01-11-RolleiFlex-Foma100-20240111_0001.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;El passat dia de reis aquesta vella &lt;strong&gt;RolleiFlex&lt;/strong&gt; dels anys 40 va fallar-me. O segurament fallaria jo amb alguna errada en mesurar la llum que no era, ni de bon tros, l&amp;rsquo;òptima. Avui en arribar a la &lt;a href="https://naubostik.com"&gt;Nau Bostik&lt;/a&gt; he tingut l&amp;rsquo;alegria de veure a la que va venir com a noia en pràctiques i ara ja ve com una treballadora més.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pobre!, li ha tocat fer de model per fer proves amb la vella andròmina. Ella s&amp;rsquo;ha portat molt bé, la càmera també.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2022-12-26 - Rolleiflex - Fomapan 100 - El Pago</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2022/12/28/2022-12-26-rolleiflex-fomapan-100-el-pago/</link><pubDate>Wed, 28 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2022/12/28/2022-12-26-rolleiflex-fomapan-100-el-pago/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/hJ8G68SjtZKvapFi7"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/BGogcYl_lKoJ_hcqkdEnjMxQMPTe1LbfimSU9zcVyLZVc-qVZWTHT4tbRd6jPbLjzlrcw89HAXJIKctwRGBjftfgn5fzpvmLmhS2HV3ZrQdPFGgFD_xPcT4WLNSTm2PXxaBtYnSiElQRK8yMa49t0-8yg35H41FHS3kYNo8p2Y1NLMovXIF4bY_cwk2ZRAKhzCQEUbBQ6t5ZfkOvgp4-c5StGiDFmtICBd9G3sDfenF7roVUXeqCgwD6ddyNyVuEZAm9hCpX6s-SPH8Sq6A46IbXD-ln7QYbpRqkqm5zxVSWVckjHGw49m0fl86RmpqoWzfCT1Abo0I21PjHmuMEFJVIFJg2YNdGAFb0MscvnrmfL9toQeNIsUX8ogw-J-8NehZFE1KqX9B0WC3goH1vgk-esCooiVQ84R3kXY7thEVs_QdPIwACMULQH98eEptueMSBxs6-Mt4yuKmdsHMnF1bIHtka64LF2fsFAQbnInKPie1uwqtvAOa-4AJe944etvvtsmoH-1SHhFqd9q9b1YMNRVzOp7JDFm4RsyhhIMNjR5mSqccRPCHa_oVqkWyvNBQGEYeBtl_kX47Vay5Awyq4KNEpYorrdkAU5qCwlfpVHJB9u83uiKYjvtIu54VV3UCC4YpWuc6eSbsu_lIabGr9SJUp_Gbm923dnqHCKIgx8PGLWZybsHh3DdB0mJrBPIIVFYlWsNPt05GUOoAf8_k_uGVOQJy32A6HnUOHzhn8TNJyz0-2awVbdb6-LN4e3P3Pfc_E38CKrJA5hdIosK1lU-xHGRif3qI3cS0-Ap3vEFcQfufX9WsaLbc2HpEMho1R5VCIkEc4JGCdwzBR10h-1zHcNE1o4Hw2JcyM9hoXfb9VvBZupbZIqRZvkknJ93oTGjjF8i-NMKL0-WzPawppnMyCm9ySpcxNGpCL9F1jfw=w1258-h1284-no?authuser=0" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
